Golden Houston.png|{{Mask tooltip|Golden Houston|color=community|20181025184151 1.jpg|So this is it- the time of reckoning. Our family of heisters against a power we haven't seen the limit of. I know one thing- we'll either come out of this together or die trying. We're the Clowns, the fucking gods of thieving, and we play by our rules. So, whatever comes next, we're ready for a blaze of golden glory.|{{color|community|'''THIS IS A COMMUNITY ITEM!'''}}}}<br/>Free
