===Normal (Hoxton's Housewarming Party)===
<tabber>Masks=
{{clr}}
''Masks unlocked by default. Upon launching the game, you will unlock {{color|value|1}} of each mask in your inventory. They can't be sold. Instead, they can be returned to your mask stash for free, but any pattern, color or material as well as the customization fee to put these together will be lost.''
