Navy Beanie.png|{{Mask tooltip|Navy Beanie|color=white|Navy Beanie full color.jpg|This fetching number will make you the talk of the town. You'll guaranteed{{sic}} to hear things like: "SEND IN THE TAZERS!", "THIS IS THE POLICE, COME OUT WITH YOUR HANDS UP!", or "WHO ARE THESE GUYS, EX-MILITARY?!"}}<br>Free
