Rhubarb.png|{{Mask tooltip|Rhubarb|color=white|20171025173300 1.jpg|A tribute to our legendary adventurer [MANY GUN] CLOVERAPTOR- solver of mysteries and bringer of The Mega Death! Giving up a dream of being a banker, he faced his destiny and faced the Cop Wizard and his minions, the Law Elementals. Who knows if it was his own will, or his pushy Crime Dad, that allowed him to prevail, but we will be forever grateful for his service.|OVERKILL Salutes You!}}<br>Free
