mask-vincent.png|{{Mask tooltip|Vincent|color=dlc|Vincentfull.jpg|Vincent the Velociraptor and his best friend Andreas HÃ¤ll Penninger the Protoceratops were out and about one day in the jungle when they got in a fight. It wasn't a big thing really but Vincent just wouldn't let it go. Andreas, being the stubborn Protoceratops he was, continued to mouth off to Vincent. Violent fighting ensued and to this day, no one is sure who actually won.|{{color|dlc|'''THIS IS AN AK/CAR MOD PACK ITEM!'''}}}}<br>Unlocked through<br>Achievement
