===The Point Break Heists DLC===
<tabber>Mask=
{{clr}}
''Requires "[[The Point Break Heists (DLC)|The Point Break Heists]]" DLC. These masks are an achievement reward. They can't drop during a PAYDAY and they can't be sold. Instead, they can be returned to your mask stash for free, but any pattern, color or material as well as the customization fee to put these together will be lost.''
