==General Trivia==
===Design Details===
* Most masks in the game have the same masking animation, however others have unique animations attributed to them, such as the various pairs of sunglasses.

===Removed or hidden masks===
{|
|[[File:Twistermask.jpg|thumb|none|128px|The Twister mask in-game.]]
|[[File:Voodoomask.jpg|thumb|none|128px|The Voodoo mask in-game.]]
|[[File:Male Mask Clown.jpg|thumb|none|128px|The Clown variant of the Male Mask in-game.]]
|[[File:Female Mask Clown.jpg|thumb|none|128px|The Clown variant of the Female Mask in-game.]]
|[[File:Missing Mask8.jpg|thumb|none|128px|Front view of the missing racing helmet in-game.]]
|[[File:Missing Mask8-2.jpg|thumb|none|128px|Rear view of the missing racing helmet in-game.]]
|}
* There are several masks that have not been added to the game. Some still exist within the games files.
** There was a mask called "The Twister" resembling [[w:c:naruto:Obito Uchiha|Tobi's mask]] from ''{{w|Naruto}}'', but it was never actually added to the black market because of copyright issues. Its files were later removed from the game and can only be obtained from older versions.
** There was a mask called "The Voodoo", but it was never added to the release of the game for unknown reasons. It is also the only mask to feature physics on a mask, which were used for the dreadlocks. Its files can only be obtained within the [[PC update history (Payday 2) Old#Beta Update #1|beta build]] of the game.
*** The [[Masks (Payday 2)#Holdout|Jamaican Nightmare]] mask also features mask physics and seems to be an evolution of the Voodoo mask.
** There is a male and female mask each with 3 variants (Blood, Clown, Stone). Their files still exist within the game, though the model files require modification before they are usable.
** There is a goalie mask with 2 variants (Blood, Shark). Their files still exist within the game, though the model file has been replaced with the Dallas mask so it no longer exists.
* With the release of the [[Car Shop]] heist there were 2 masks added to the game. Only one is currently made available to unlock though while the other remains in the game's files.

